Output docs/public/media/cli-doctor.mp4
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 22
Set Width 1400
Set Height 480
Set Padding 30
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Set WindowBar Colorful
Hide
Type "source docs/media-src/demo-env.sh && clear"
Enter
Show
Type "omavn doctor"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
